You drink deeper from the timeline of others. Each time you apply atrophy you gain [0.7%, 1.1%, 1.3%, 1.5%, 1.8% (TL1-5)] spell speed per atrophy stack on the target and cause them to lose [1%, 3%, 4%, 5%, 5% (TL1-5)] of a turn.

The highest atrophy stack found will be used for the spell speed calculation.
